RNkRO34Ql35MSM4jqVWokjXwgYL5k1Z3D6iudHHOuZBo-R-UStn-8wAHg4Qb12afAu2QfDUCI_RhbqcidmTchZmdxl9x-Wq0CryR1DpDH_RFESQ4yRnJx0BXZFRPe0FV5jH4rqSN5Fp4UmQMgOkbZI2YOw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1320},{"id":"18141","date":"2026-11-26T08:40:33+00:00","text":"𝐌𝐀𝐓𝐂𝐇𝐃𝐀𝐘! 🏆 Europa League 🏟 Juventus Stadium 🆚 Juventus vs Omonia ⏰ 21:00 (IT)","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/EoqcO6Pl6HyrNDvhJqFPFDyMCmf4FZck5OsQt-LvF-vfxjPxH8ILmakYvk9kmkF5AQSE0mNjNHNas0I2CzPxG6nXS8S4pA3cB7GcIGrDCqbFaRrhWu0dICpkM0uJNDpg56upPQLtE1XzkbRzXSEfoyVmNWLuvE5Y-leUURtxOyT011MlW3P_-AmPb7hDRKxFrhect0__CV9dmv3VhICqGRkzBWv87ypRb7l_eMjq_llzyM6nUC5E4P_0I0lhdJXa-g7Xs1yMtAh6x3FHBmMfyxxE3mgJSrBBXeB8CYadARp9D6fxBepz4-HplmrVrMaedpo2F27x0-LD4dfG6tpafg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1270},{"id":"18140","date":"2026-11-25T18:00:13+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti on Ekhator: \"I see him as a penalty-box striker, a physical forward who attacks space and can turn difficult balls into playable ones.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1340},{"id":"18139","date":"2026-11-25T17:59:54+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"I can’t play those two [Nick and Kolo Muani] together all the time, especially with matches on Sunday, Thursday and Sunday. We have a crucial league game on Sunday, so I need to be able to change things around","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1280},{"id":"18138","date":"2026-11-25T17:59:43+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"Hopefully, Ekhator can show us he has qualities that others might lack, giving us more options to rotate","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1310},{"id":"18137","date":"2026-11-25T17:59:27+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"I’ve never spoken badly about Woltemade or Kolo Muani. I’ve always spoken positively about them. We’re simply talking about a specific characteristic.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1210},{"id":"18136","date":"2026-11-25T17:59:12+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"Physical presence is a way to gain territory when opponents press us aggressively. There are two players who can help us turn any situation around: the goalkeeper and the number nine.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1110},{"id":"18135","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:58+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"Physical presence isn’t just about scoring goals. It also helps us hold the ball when the game becomes tight.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":976},{"id":"18134","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:48+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"We’re looking at whether we can find that profile within the squad. Nico Gonzalez can also play as a striker; he has the qualities of a number nine","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":962},{"id":"18133","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:40+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"Jeff Ekhator made several appearances last season, although he didn’t play many full games. He’s a promising player and is now in better physical condition.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":983},{"id":"18132","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:27+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"You say Woltemade doesn’t appeal to me, suggesting we lack a physical profile. If Jeff Ekhator shows he has what it takes, we already have those qualities in the squad.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1010},{"id":"18131","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:17+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"I tried Kolo Muani in that position again because I need him there [as a striker]. I have very good wingers, and I believe I can use Kolo there again, as I did against Venezia. Woltemade cannot play every game.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1070},{"id":"18130","date":"2026-11-25T17:58:04+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti: \"Need a physical striker? It seemed more like a desperate cry from you journalists! We always come back to the striker debate. Do you want me to take you back through how many times you’ve asked me about Vlahović, even after he left?\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1010},{"id":"18129","date":"2026-11-25T17:57:52+00:00","text":"🚨 🎙️ Luciano Spalletti on injuries: \"We’ve got some players back, except Nico González and Kalulu, along with those who have longer-term injuries. We’re in good shape and working on the game situations that suit us best.\"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false,"views":1020}]